はA。罰ゲームはアイドルを引退してAVに出演する事だった。しかし、それは女優としてではなく男優として出演する事だった。\n\n対決\n1戦目\n樋口円香対福丸小糸\nオナニー早絶頂対決\nオナニーで早くイった方が勝ち\n勝者福丸小糸\n敗者罰ゲーム\n腹踊り謝罪\n\n2戦目\n斑鳩ルカ対鈴木羽那\n浣腸我慢対決\n先に脱糞した方が負け\n勝者斑鳩ルカ\n敗者罰ゲーム\n勝者の脱糞を顔面で受ける\n\n3戦目\n緋田美琴対七草にちか\n69早イかせ対決\n勝者七草にちか\n敗者罰ゲーム\n丸坊主猿真似\n\n総合敗者罰ゲーム\nAV男優デビュー\n樋口円香　男体化　粗チン\n斑鳩ルカ　おっさん化　巨チン\n緋田美琴　ガチムチ丸坊主　巨チン\n\nぜひお願いします。", "nc": 171, "word_count": 20969, "transcoder": "text", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 426769, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "でくすたー@Skeb依頼募集中", "screen_name": "ryooonaaaa", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/998934487563091972/pnkPAnz8.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "novel"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 185}, {"id": 611205, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "huu🔞モフみをよこせ", "screen_name": "mohujirou1811", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1573279794992910336/BruoIHom.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1065153800267194368/1750522052/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 32}, {"id": 722530, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "三角筋ギア", "screen_name": "sankaku_gear", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1963226316272287744/SPjA3cta.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptabl